{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "页面链路",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 68.98,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg2-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.28,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.687
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "用户不读合约，用户读页面。",
   "spoken": "用户不读合约，用户读页面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg2-01.wav",
   "start": 3.1,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 3.1,
   "speechEnd": 5.749
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "页面告诉你，这笔交易是什么。",
   "spoken": "页面告诉你，这笔交易是什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg2-02.wav",
   "start": 6.2,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speechStart": 6.293,
   "speechEnd": 8.329
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "钱包再把页面构造好的交易，交给你签名。",
   "spoken": "钱包再把页面构造好的交易，交给你签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg2-03.wav",
   "start": 8.74,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 8.74,
   "speechEnd": 12.061
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "攻击者改掉页面，你就会对着一个审计过的合约，签下攻击交易。",
   "spoken": "攻击者改掉页面，你就会对着一个审计过的合约，签下攻击交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg2-04.wav",
   "start": 12.48,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 12.48,
   "speechEnd": 17.181
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "前端，就是浏览器里的网页，和它加载的全部脚本。",
   "spoken": "前端，就是浏览器里的网页，和它加载的全部脚本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg2-05.wav",
   "start": 17.66,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 17.753,
   "speechEnd": 22.053
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "打个比方，银行柜台的玻璃上，贴着收款账号。",
   "spoken": "打个比方，银航柜台的玻璃上，贴着收款账号。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg2-06.wav",
   "start": 22.52,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 22.614,
   "speechEnd": 26.091
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "金库、账本、保安都没问题，但有人夜里换了这张贴纸。",
   "spoken": "金库、账本、保安都没问题，但有人夜里换了这张贴纸。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg2-07.wav",
   "start": 26.5,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 26.5,
   "speechEnd": 31.975
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "第二天，客户都把钱汇进新账号。",
   "spoken": "第二天，客户都把钱汇进新账号。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg2-08.wav",
   "start": 32.4,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 32.495,
   "speechEnd": 35.307
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "比喻在这里不成立，换贴纸要进银行大厅。",
   "spoken": "比喻在这里不成立，换贴纸要进银航大厅。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg2-09.wav",
   "start": 35.74,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 35.838,
   "speechEnd": 39.22
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "改前端可以在千里之外完成，而且能只对某一个客户显示假贴纸。",
   "spoken": "改前端可以在千里之外完成，而且能只对某一个客户显示假贴纸。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg2-10.wav",
   "start": 39.64,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 39.64,
   "speechEnd": 45.684
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "页面从源码到你的浏览器，要经过一整串环节。",
   "spoken": "页面从源码到你的浏览器，要经过一整串环节。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg2-11.wav",
   "start": 46.1,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 46.1,
   "speechEnd": 50.235
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "开发者的电脑、代码仓库、依赖包、构建、托管、CDN，最后是域名。",
   "spoken": "开发者的电脑、代码仓库、依赖包、构建、托管、CDN，最后是域名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg2-12.wav",
   "start": 50.64,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 50.64,
   "speechEnd": 56.919
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "这一整串，叫供应链。",
   "spoken": "这一整串，叫公应链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg2-13.wav",
   "start": 57.34,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 57.34,
   "speechEnd": 59.283
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "任何一环被攻破，结果都一样，你的浏览器运行着攻击者的代码。",
   "spoken": "任何一环被攻破，结果都一样，你的浏览器运行着攻击者的代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg2-14.wav",
   "start": 59.72,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 59.812,
   "speechEnd": 64.411
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "合约审计，覆盖不到其中任何一环。",
   "spoken": "合约审计，覆盖不到其中任何一环。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg2-15.wav",
   "start": 64.82,
   "dur": 2.96,
